<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Trust to unveil earnings revision.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Trust to unveil earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Trust &amp; Banking Corp said on Friday it would make an announcement at 3.45 p.m. (0645 GMT) on sales of some of its fixed assets and a revision of its earnings forecast for the fiscal year to March 31.</p>
</text>
